# Gemstone Mine's {T} cost can be paid once a turn (CR 602.2b): after Bot1 taps it for blue on turn 1 it is refused a
# second activation, and with two counters left it is not sacrificed ("if there are no mining counters"). On turn 3 it is
# untapped again (the control) and gives green, any color being allowed (CR 106.1b); one counter is left.

[Bot1 Deck]
Gemstone Mine
Island x6
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Gemstone Mine.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Gemstone Mine.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Gemstone Mine)
? Bot1.Mana = {U}
! Bot1.Battlefield.Gemstone Mine.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Gemstone Mine.Counters.Mining = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Gemstone Mine.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Choose(Tap Gemstone Mine)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Gemstone Mine
Bot1.Battlefield.Gemstone Mine.Counters.Mining = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Gemstone Mine.Tapped = true
